  # WARNING + SKIPPED, never GREEN. Never baselined or allowlisted. Added under
  # ADR-180 §1.
  python3 tools/rtsan_check.py || return 1

  # THREAD SAFETY, THE MAIN-THREAD/AUDIO-THREAD HANDOFF (B448 B2, ADR-197 risk
  # row 2, ADR-199). The real shell under ThreadSanitizer: the audio thread
  # renders while the host/editor main thread loads, saves, edits, morphs,
  # navigates history and presses PANIC, over three seeded schedules. Red on
  # ANY report whose main-thread access is a WRITE (TSan's own access type,
  # the human's ruling of 2026-10-09); reports where the main thread only
  # READS are counted and printed as accepted. Calibrated every run: a planted
  # main-thread write must be reported and filed as a WRITE, a planted
